{
  "BK_1000_0030_NAR": "These were faeries, nefarious \r\ncreatures who ensnare the souls \r\nof humans who venture into\r\nthe woods to feed on their vitality.",
  "PH_1030_0000_CER": "I feel the same energy as before\r\nComing from that plant...",
  "BK_1060_0080_NAR": "[FONT:9 ]Who's going to be the appetizer,\r\nand who shall I save for dessert![FONT:N ]\r\nroared Cheshire, his mane rippling and claws extended.",
  "LV_001070_0000_CER": "Looks like there's a path above us too.",
  "BK_1060_0000_CER": "“Where did that wolf \r\nrun off to now?”",
  "PH_1b01_0010_NAR": "It seemed that destroying the device at \r\nthe core of that rift somehow disrupted the \r\nillusion, revealing the true path forward.",
  "IN_1000_0030_CER": "D-don't surprise me like that!",
  "PH_1b01_0020_NAR": "They spotted the white wolf.\r\nWithout a moment's hesitation,\r\nthe pair gave chase.",
  "SM_001100_0140_MOR": "“This forest belongs to the faeries.\r\nHowever, if you search carefully,\r\nI am sure you will find objects that\r\nwill help you develop your magic abilities.”",
  "LV_001005_0010_CER": "Come on, Cereza,\r\none foot in front of the other...",
  "BK_1000_0000_NAR": "Cereza could not shake the\r\nfeeling she was being watched.",
  "SM_001020_0000_CER": "“What's wrong?”",
  "SM_001020_0080_NAR": "[FONT:9 ]How do you plan on getting \r\nme back to Inferno?[FONT:N ]\r\nthe demon demanded.",
  "SM_001100_0260_CER": "“Well, back to chasing the white wolf.\r\nIf we get that power, even Miss High-and-\r\nMighty Morgana will sing our praises.”",
  "SM_001090_0020_NAR": "Somehow disrupted the illusion,\r\nrevealing the true path forward.",
  "SM_001090_0020_NAR#2": "They spotted the white wolf.\r\nWithout a moment's hesitation,\r\nthe pair gave chase.",
  "SM_001040_0030_NAR": "Cereza ran to pick up Cheshire\r\nand held him tightly to her chest.\r\nIn her arms, Cheshire\r\nfelt his strength returning.",
  "LV_001145_0000_NAR": "The path continued to a line of arching trees, \r\nwhich had grown together to form a tunnel.",
  "BK_1010_0020_NAR": "As if bound by an invisible force,\r\nno matter how he struggled,\r\nhe was unable to touch Cereza.",
  "SM_001040_0080_CER": "“Just hold still, will you!\r\nWhile you're small you\r\ncan't walk on your own, right?\r\nI'll carry you until you\r\ncan transform again.”",
  "SM_001090_0010_NAR": "It seemed that destroying the \r\ndevice at the core of that rift",
  "BK_1010_0010_NAR": "But what have we here?\r\nThe demon had stopped cold.\r\n",
  "SM_001070_0040_NAR": "Equally confused,\r\nthe girl and demon exchanged a glance.",
  "BK_1020_0140_CER": "“W-what was that? \r\nI feel funny...”",
  "BK_1020_0050_NAR": "Leaping from Cereza's grasp,\r\nCheshire lunged towards the wolf.",
  "LV_001130_0010_NAR": "In one corner was a rock, polished to a shiny finish.\r\nThis would make a good substitute \r\nfor the mirror she used when training.",
  "BK_1010_0060_NAR": "Giving up his attack,\r\nthe demon turned \r\nhis attention elsewhere.",
  "LV_001915_0000_CER": "How am I supposed to find my way in here...?\r\n",
  "LV_001080_0000_CER": "A white wolf...\r\nIt's just like that boy said!",
  "LV_001095_0010_NAR": "A small glade of otherworldly \r\nbeauty opened before Cereza.",
  "PH_1010_0010_CER": "Is...is someone out there?",
  "SM_001010_0080_NAR": "Looking around, the demon's \r\neyes found Cereza.\r\nIt let out a low growl.",
  "SM_001040_0070_NAR": "[FONT:9 ]Release me at once![FONT:N ]\r\nEven in this form,\r\nthe demon did not seem\r\nhappy about being cuddled.",
  "SM_001100_0220_CER": "“Wh-what was that?!\r\nMorgana is my master, and I will \r\nnot have you speak of her in that way!”",
  "SM_001010_0000_CER": "“Ch-Cheshire?”",
  "BK_1020_0020_NAR": "Just as Cereza took a step\r\ntowards the pillar to investigate...",
  "SM_001070_0030_NAR": "Upon close inspection,\r\nthere appeared to be distortions,\r\nas if the air itself had cracked.",
  "BK_1020_0090_CER": "“Cheshire, stop and listen\r\nfor a second!”",
  "BK_1020_0010_NAR": "Before it stood the white wolf.\r\n",
  "SM_001120_0030_CER": "“B-but, I'm sure this power will \r\ncome in handy for something too!”",
  "SM_001070_0000_NAR": "The pair searched high and low for the wolf,\r\nbut it had vanished without a trace.",
  "LV_001095_0020_NAR": "This dark forest held secrets yet.\r\nCereza relaxed, ever so slightly.",
  "LV_001915_0030_CER": "Does this brace...\r\nHave the power to dispel illusions?",
  "SM_001010_0120_NAR": "Cereza had her hands full \r\ncalling a demon to this world.\r\nShe hadn't even begun to\r\nstudy the spell to send them back.",
  "SM_001010_0030_CER": "“Wait...did I manage to summon a demon,\r\nthat has now possessed Cheshire?”",
  "SM_001040_0040_NAR": "Cereza calmed down and\r\nher fear subsided.",
  "BK_1060_0040_CER": "“W-why don't you flock off already\r\nand leave us alone!”",
  "BK_1000_0160_CER": "“You don't think...\r\nCould that have been...”",
  "SM_001100_0130_MOR": "“Cereza...Well, it will have to do.\r\nIf you are able to wield that demon,\r\nyour chances of survival \r\nwill increase greatly.”",
  "IN_1030_0000_CER": "“Uh oh,\r\nI can't get down.\r\n\r\nHey Cheshire, can you find\r\na way to get me down from here?”",
  "BK_1000_0040_NAR": "This time there was nowhere to run.\r\nCereza was backed into a corner.",
  "SM_001100_0170_NAR": "The light of the moon began to wane.\r\nWith it Morgana's visage grew faint.\r\nIt was as if the forest itself\r\nconspired to impede their plans.",
  "LV_001105_0010_CER": "Just what could they be guarding...",
  "SM_001100_0090_MOR": "“You just find a safe place,\r\nand try to stay alive until I find\r\na way to save you.”",
  "BK_1030_0000_NAR": "Once their eyes had adjusted to brilliant light,\r\nwhat lay before them was a sight\r\nunlike anything either had seen before.",
  "LV_001020_0000_NAR": "Cereza finally found somewhere she could rest.",
  "SM_001060_0010_NAR": "Before them stood a large wolf.\r\nIts snow-white fur shone\r\npale silver in the moonlight.",
  "IN_1050_0000_NAR": "The massive spheres in the strange contraption aligned, \r\nand a path of light appeared before them.",
  "BK_1040_0050_LUC": "“You...can do it...”",
  "BK_1000_0010_CER": "“I-is someone there? \r\nShow yourself!”",
  "BK_1050_0010_MOR": "“So, I have finally found you, Cereza.”",
  "BK_1000_0100_NAR": "The faeries resumed their sinister mission.\r\nAll at once they jumped at Cereza, weapons poised to strike.",
  "BK_1060_0020_NAR": "All of a sudden a tough-looking faerie \r\nappeared out of nowhere!\r\nCereza was startled,\r\nbut tried to regain her composure.",
  "SM_001060_0040_CER": "“Hey...wait!”",
  "LV_001065_0000_CER": "Okay, I'll go on ahead by myself.",
  "IN_1000_0010_NAR": "She cautiously ventured onwards.\r\n",
  "SM_001100_0190_NAR": "The remaining moonlight faded,\r\nand Morgana disappeared.",
  "BK_1040_0060_LUC": "“Follow...\r\nWhite wolf...”",
  "LV_001130_0000_CER": "What is this...!?",
  "LV_001075_0020_CER": "Perhaps I'm not the first \r\nwitch to enter this forest...",
  "BK_1020_0040_CER": "“Wait, what are you doing?!”",
  "BK_1020_0150_NAR": "[FONT:9 ]Don't hog the power girl![FONT:N ]\r\nCheshire roared his protest.",
  "SM_001120_0060_NAR": "Speaking of that wolf...\r\nWhere did he go now?",
  "SM_001010_0060_NAR": "The creature had desperately sought\r\na medium in order to survive in our world.\r\nIn lieu of hair, it settled for one made of felt.\r\n",
  "SM_001100_0240_NAR": "Cereza wished that just once\r\nMorgana would tell her she did a good job.",
  "BK_1010_0030_CER": "“Calm down, \r\nyou're going to burst a seam!”",
  "SM_001040_0020_CER": "“Cheshire!”",
  "SM_001010_0050_NAR": "Just as Cereza feared,\r\na demon had indeed possessed\r\nher beloved stuffed cat.",
  "LV_001130_0030_CER": "Worth a try...",
  "SM_001020_0090_CER": "“We first need to find a white wolf.\r\nHe'll show us the way.”",
  "SM_001070_0060_CER": "“Try using magic to open it?\r\nCome on, we have no idea what's \r\nlurking on the other side!”",
  "BK_1020_0160_NAR": "He wanted his piece of the pie.\r\nBut what exactly had they released?\r\n",
  "SM_001020_0010_NAR": "The demon bared his fangs.\r\nHe was clearly suffering.",
  "SM_001010_0020_NAR": "From its gaping maw, extending ear to ear,\r\nfell a drop of thick slobber.",
  "LV_001915_0020_NAR": "The light from the brace revealed\r\nthings Cereza was unable to see before.",
  "BK_1010_0040_CER": "“Don't worry, I'll send you home!\r\nOnce I figure out how...”",
  "LV_001100_0000_CER": "Is this...faerie treasure?\r\nThey'd be hopping mad if I stole it.",
  "SM_001020_0060_NAR": "The demon seemed to have calmed down.\r\nRemembering that he could not touch her,\r\nCereza breathed a sigh of relief.",
  "SM_001020_0170_CER": "“Well I need to call you something.\r\nIf you're going to make a fuss about it,\r\nwhy don't you just find a new body!”",
  "LV_001030_0000_CER": "Cheshire, I've got it tied down! \r\nFinish it!",
  "BK_1020_0080_NAR": "Cheshire was fed up with this\r\nwild wolf chase. He wanted answers.",
  "LV_001025_0010_NAR": "The instant Cheshire had a sniff,\r\nhe started pawing at Cereza to get far away.",
  "BK_1020_0120_NAR": "Missing his mark,\r\nCheshire's claws struck\r\nthe Elemental Core instead.\r\nAll was quiet. Until...",
  "SM_001070_0020_CER": "“There's something here...”",
  "IN_1020_0015_NAR": "His power seemed to escape him, \r\nslowly but surely.",
  "LV_001025_0020_NAR": "Rosemary is despised by the denizens of Inferno. \r\nThey needed to find another route.",
  "SM_001020_0140_CER": "“You don't have a name?\r\nThat must be terribly inconvenient.\r\n\r\nThough I must admit, I haven't\r\nthe faintest idea about demonic manners.”",
  "SM_001010_0010_NAR": "Cereza's stuffed cat Cheshire\r\ntransformed into some kind of beast\r\nright before her eyes.",
  "IN_1020_0000_NAR": "The demon ran through the forest,\r\nsearching for a way home.",
  "SM_001010_0100_CER": "“You...you want me to return you to Inferno?”",
  "LV_001915_0010_NAR": "Suddenly, Cereza's magic brace\r\nbegan to glow. What could it be?",
  "LV_001900_0000_CER": "Hm?\r\nLook what we have here!",
  "IN_1050_0010_CER": "“This thing is massive...\r\nI wonder what it's for?”",
  "IN_1000_0060_NAR": "As the wind rustled the leaves,\r\nit sounded just like a rasping voice\r\nwhispered in her ear.",
  "SM_001060_0000_CER": "“Hey, look over there...”",
  "BK_1030_0010_CER": "“Cheshire, I've a feeling \r\nwe're not in Avalon any more.”",
  "SM_001100_0070_NAR": "This ancient enchantment was so\r\nstrong even Morgana herself \r\ncould not easily break it.",
  "BK_1000_0140_NAR": "Chomp!",
  "BK_1040_0010_LUC": "“Centre...Forest...\r\n...waiting...”",
  "BK_1000_0050_CER": "“Please...Please work this time!”",
  "SM_001100_0040_NAR": "Although this was only a projection \r\nof Morgana, her scolding somehow \r\nmanaged to be even more\r\nintimidating than the genuine article. \r\nCereza could only hang her head.",
  "BK_1000_0170_NAR": "But before Cereza could \r\nfinish her question--",
  "BK_1040_0020_LUC": "“Help me...Power....”",
  "SM_001100_0030_MOR": "“But really Cereza, to enter the forest\r\ndespite all my warnings;\r\nyou even made off with my magic brace.\r\nJust what were you thinking!”",
  "LV_001055_0000_CER": "Whoa, that's new!",
  "SM_001100_0150_CER": "“What about these sparkly things?\r\nI've picked up a bunch of them\r\nsince I got here.”",
  "LV_001905_0000_NAR": "The world before Cereza seemed to warp and bend.\r\nShe blinked hard to no avail.",
  "IN_1000_0050_NAR": "Looking into the dark underbrush,\r\nCereza could not shake the feeling\r\nthat someone was looking back.",
  "BK_1050_0005_NAR": "As she approached,\r\nthe magic brace on Cereza's wrist\r\nbegan to glow. ",
  "SM_001010_0140_NAR": "Out of patience,\r\nhe pounced!",
  "LV_001150_0000_CER": "Wow, look at this...",
  "LV_001145_0010_NAR": "Could it be that the faeries \r\nwere trying to protect this place?",
  "SM_001100_0270_CER": "“Oh yeah, those little sparkly things...\r\nShe said they might help you grow stronger.\r\nI wonder what that means...”",
  "SM_001020_0180_CER": "“Fine. I'll just call you whatever I please.”",
  "LV_001075_0010_NAR": "There were signs that\r\na witch had set up camp here.",
  "LV_001060_0000_CER": "More rosemary...",
  "BK_1020_0070_NAR": "[FONT:9 ]Stop running and tell us\r\nhow to get that power already![FONT:N ]",
  "SM_001020_0100_NAR": "[FONT:9 ]Leave it to me, I'll find 'im,[FONT:N ]\r\nsaid the demon as he clambered to his feet.",
  "SM_001060_0050_LUC": "“Avalon Forest...\r\nThe white wolf...guide you...”",
  "SM_001120_0050_CER": "“I know, I know!\r\nThat is why we're following that\r\nwolf in the first place!”",
  "SM_001020_0130_NAR": "[FONT:9 ]I have no name,[FONT:N ]\r\nreplied the demon curtly.",
  "SM_001070_0050_NAR": "[FONT:9 ]That wolf is just up ahead![FONT:N ]\r\nCheshire's indecision did not last long.\r\nBut try as he might, he was unable to\r\nopen the cracks any further.",
  "SM_001020_0020_CER": "“Are you sick?\r\nOr hungry, perhaps?” ",
  "BK_1010_0000_NAR": "Claws like daggers descended \r\non Cereza!",
  "LV_001015_0010_CER": "Cranky one, are you?\r\nI know just the spell to put you in your place! ",
  "SM_001040_0010_NAR": "All at once, Cheshire's body shrunk \r\nto its original cuddly form.",
  "SM_001040_0090_CER": "“Not having a massive demon\r\nbreathing down my neck will make\r\nit easier for me to calm down too.”",
  "SM_001090_0000_NAR": "They had returned from the strange world.\r\nThe forest was just as they had left it,\r\nexcept...not quite.",
  "LV_001070_0010_CER": "Cheshire, I'll toss you up there.\r\nSee if there's a way forward.",
  "BK_1060_0010_CER": "“What's that over there?\r\nLet's go check it out!”",
  "PH_1b01_0000_NAR": "They had returned from the strange world.\r\nThe forest was just as they had left it,\r\nexcept...not quite.",
  "BK_1000_0020_NAR": "\r\nAnd then, as if to answer her call...\r\n",
  "SM_001100_0160_MOR": "“Yes...That crystalline structure \r\nis a stable source of magical energy.\r\nIf you feed it to the demon it\r\nmay awaken some new powers.”",
  "BK_1000_0130_CER": "“What...who are you?”",
  "SM_001100_0000_CER": "“Morgana!?” ",
  "BK_1000_0090_CER": "“Why!? I did everything right...”",
  "LV_001005_0000_CER": "Don't look down. ",
  "LV_001910_0010_NAR": "As soon as she took a step inside,\r\nshe felt as if the breath had frozen in her chest.",
  "BK_1000_0060_NAR": "Fingers crossed, Cereza prepared \r\nto use the summoning spell \r\nshe learned from Morgana.",
  "SM_001060_0030_NAR": "Cereza was captivated by the wolf.\r\nIt seemed almost not of this world. ",
  "LV_001035_0000_CER": "I'll go first and make a path.\r\nYou wait here.",
  "IN_1030_0020_CER": "“I didn't mean take the whole tree down!”",
  "SM_001100_0110_MOR": "“Is that...\r\nYou summoned a demon \r\ninto your stuffed toy?”",
  "LV_001910_0020_NAR": "All around her were sights strange \r\nand terrible, as if she had been \r\ndragged into a waking nightmare.",
  "LV_001905_0030_CER": "I'm getting ready, just give me a second!",
  "LV_001110_0010_NAR": "[FONT:10 ]It's because they know you're weak![FONT:N ]\r\nCheshire patronised Cereza.",
  "SM_001100_0080_MOR": "“For now all I can do is support \r\nyou from afar. I will begin \r\nresearching ways out of the forest.”",
  "LV_001105_0000_CER": "I've never seen a barrier like that before.\r\nI'll bet the faeries are behind this.",
  "SM_001120_0090_NAR": "The bickering companions left\r\nthe remains of the core behind them,\r\nheading ever deeper into the forest.",
  "SM_001120_0010_CER": "“No, this is something different...\r\n\r\n\r\nWe need to smash three more of \r\nthose things before I can send you back.”",
  "SM_001020_0050_CER": "“What's that? \r\nI need to stay close to you?\r\nI've never heard of a spell like this before...”",
  "PH_1010_0000_CER": "What was that!?\r\nMust have been a rabbit, or something,\r\nright Cheshire?",
  "SM_001010_0090_NAR": "After her initial terror,\r\nCereza realised that she was able to\r\nunderstand what the demon was saying.",
  "SM_001100_0230_CER": "“I feel bad for worrying her...\r\nBut I don't get why she's so \r\nover-protective. I mean, I summoned \r\na demon and everything!”",
  "LV_001050_0000_CER": "Huh, even with you in there,\r\nCheshire still weighs the same as before.",
  "BK_1010_0070_NAR": "Intrigued, but a little scared,\r\nCereza decided to follow a bit behind.",
  "LV_001080_0010_CER": "So if we follow that wolf...\r\nCome on Cheshire, let's hurry!",
  "BK_1040_0000_CER": "“You're the boy from my dream...”",
  "BK_1040_0030_CER": "“Okay,\r\nI just need to follow\r\nthe white wolf, right?”",
  "SM_001010_0130_NAR": "Cereza once again heard the demon's words,\r\nthis time even more clearly.\r\n[FONT:9 ]Send me back! Send me back![FONT:N ]\r\nThe demon's rage\r\nincreased by the second,\r\nbut there was nothing Cereza could do.",
  "SM_001070_0090_CER": "“I am not making excuses!”\r\n",
  "SM_001070_0010_NAR": "[FONT:9 ]This way![FONT:N ]\r\nCheshire was onto the wolf's scent.",
  "SM_001070_0100_CER": "“All right fine! \r\nOkay Cereza, just like you practised...”",
  "BK_1020_0000_NAR": "A strange orb atop a pillar...\r\nCould this be the Elemental Core\r\nof which the boy in Cereza's dream\r\nhad spoken?",
  "SM_001100_0250_NAR": "She had already forgotten \r\nMorgana's scolding.",
  "SM_001040_0110_NAR": "While far from pleased about being\r\ntreated like a stuffed animal,\r\nthe demon had no choice but\r\nto swallow his pride.",
  "LV_001015_0000_NAR": "This was quite a pickle.\r\nBut Cereza knew how to get by without a scratch.",
  "SM_001020_0030_NAR": "As Cereza approached, the demon felt\r\nthe strength return to his body.\r\nIn an instant, he felt right as rain.",
  "SM_001120_0070_NAR": "To find the other Elemental Cores,\r\nthey first need to find him.",
  "SM_001020_0120_CER": "“Um...I'm Cereza.\r\nWhat's your name?”",
  "LV_001075_0030_CER": "Ah well,\r\nit means we've got a place to rest.",
  "LV_001075_0000_CER": "What have we here...",
  "LV_001130_0020_CER": "Hey...\r\nWithout Morgana breathing down my neck,\r\nI might be able to get in some good practice.",
  "SM_001020_0190_NAR": "And so, these strange companions\r\nset off in search of the white wolf.\r\nWhat mysteries await\r\nin Avalon Forest?",
  "SM_001010_0040_NAR": "As if in reply\r\nthe beast growled and\r\nbared its blood-red fangs.",
  "LV_001150_0010_NAR": "There was a serenity to this place \r\nthat calmed Cereza's nerves.",
  "BK_1000_0110_NAR": "She shut her eyes tight, \r\nand prepared for the worst.\r\nA moment passed. And then another,\r\nbut she felt not so much\r\nas a pinprick.",
  "SM_001100_0050_MOR": "“I am looking forward to a thorough \r\nexplanation once you're home safe.\r\nBut I am afraid escaping \r\nAvalon Forest will not be easy.”",
  "BK_1040_0040_LUC": "“Destroy...\r\nFour...Elemental Cores...”",
  "BK_1000_0080_NAR": "Even after the summoning \r\ncircle had faded away,\r\nno one had answered her call...",
  "LV_001010_0000_CER": "A plant from Inferno?\r\nI wonder how it would\r\nrespond to my magic...",
  "SM_001100_0010_NAR": "Cereza blinked in disbelief as\r\nthe ghostly figure of her teacher\r\nappeared from within the moonlight.",
  "AC_CEREZA010_0010_CER": "White wolf, wait!",
  "SM_001100_0100_CER": "“Don't worry, Morgana!\r\nLook, I was able to summon \r\na demon of my very own!”",
  "IN_1000_0080_CER": "I can't turn back now...\r\nI'm going to become a witch,\r\nand save Mummy!",
  "IN_1000_0000_NAR": "Massive trees blocked almost all light from \r\nthe moon. An eerie silence enveloped Cereza.",
  "LV_001920_0000_CER": "H-hey! Where am I standing?!",
  "LV_001110_0000_CER": "Those cheeky faeries...\r\nwhat's their problem!?",
  "LV_001905_0020_NAR": "[FONT:10 ]Come on, we've still got that wolf to catch.[FONT:N ]",
  "LV_001910_0030_CER": "I-I'm fine!\r\nIt takes more than this to scare me!",
  "SM_001100_0060_NAR": "Morgana's expression was grave.\r\nShe explained how the faeries' \r\nmagic turned the forest into \r\na labyrinthine trap; one in which \r\nCereza was currently ensnared.",
  "BK_1000_0150_NAR": "That beast, as dark as a moonless night...\r\nHad it all been a dream?",
  "SM_001100_0180_MOR": "“Cereza, listen well: demons \r\nare weapons which we witches \r\nwield, not friends to be cuddled.\r\nRemember to treat them as such.”",
  "BK_1060_0070_NAR": "Cheshire let out a sigh\r\nas he pushed past Cereza\r\nto face down the faerie.",
  "SM_001020_0200_NAR": "",
  "PH_1060_0000_CER": "White wolf, wait!",
  "LV_001905_0010_NAR": "Could this be a faerie trick?\r\nCheshire was losing patience with his hesitant companion.",
  "SM_001100_0020_MOR": "“Thank goodness you're safe...\r\nWhen I realised you'd gone to the forest,\r\nI was beside myself with worry.”",
  "LV_001910_0000_CER": "What is this...?",
  "BK_1050_0000_NAR": "In a nearby grove,\r\nthere was a place \r\nilluminated by moonlight.",
  "LV_001025_0000_NAR": "The fresh scent tickled Cereza's nose. \r\nIt was rosemary, typically used \r\nto ward off evil spirits.",
  "SM_001070_0080_NAR": "Cheshire gave a mocking snort\r\nat Cereza's cowardice.",
  "BK_1010_0050_CER": "“I'm on my way to get \r\na fantastic power.\r\nWith that, sending you back should\r\nbe a piece of cake!”",
  "SM_001100_0210_NAR": "Cheshire was in a foul mood.",
  "LV_001900_0010_CER": "I'm not too shabby with concoctions you know.\r\nLet's give this a try.",
  "SM_001010_0110_CER": "“Now, how would one go about doing that?”\r\n",
  "IN_1020_0010_NAR": "The demon slashed with his\r\nrazor-sharp claws...but something felt off.",
  "SM_001020_0150_CER": "“May I call you Cheshire?\r\nThat's the name of the stuffed cat \r\nyou decided to borrow, after all.”",
  "BK_1020_0130_NAR": "Energy poured from the core like a furious whirlpool.\r\nStanding in its midst, Cereza felt a strange power flow through her.",
  "SM_001020_0040_NAR": "His body was linked \r\nto Cereza by powerful magic.\r\nMoving away from her\r\nrobbed it of its energy.",
  "SM_001120_0000_NAR": "The pair had gained a new ability.\r\n[FONT:9 ]Is this it? I can go home now?[FONT:N ]\r\nCheshire asked excitedly.",
  "SM_001120_0080_CER": "“I swear, you demons are \r\nmore trouble than you're worth!”"
}
